index/build_index.py generates index/ai-dom.json on YOUR machine from Illustrator's own type library
(Plug-ins/Extensions/ScriptingSupport.aip) plus runtime checks. index/raw/ holds the menu-command names and the
localized menu text exported by Illustrator's Edit > Keyboard Shortcuts dialog (tools/capture_commands.py
re-captures them from your installation). presets/effects.json lists effect parameter names read back from files
saved by Illustrator. No Adobe documentation or third-party index is redistributed in this repository.

